{{!
    @template local_rangeos/icon_search

    The magnifier on a search button. Decorative: the button carries its own label, so
    the glyph is hidden from assistive technology.

    One of this plugin's hand-drawn glyphs. They share a 24x24 box and a 2.2 stroke in
    currentColor, so a button's own colour carries the icon; keep any new one in step.
    Moodle's own pix_icons are used where an icon stands for a management area instead
    (see \local_rangeos\output\dashboard::areas).

    Context variables required: none.

    Example context (json):
    { }
}}
